  - statementId: 3
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: Hmm... Firstly there are ordinary items Then there are those with modifiable items which are rare items. One of them is called a unique item, which is specially made of  good quality items, but it is hard to find. If you do find it please take good care of it. And... even though I have never seen it with my own eyes, I know of one more very rare item. Please look at Main Centre's item details to find out more. And then there's one more quest item which shouldn't be simply used, this item is one of which even I wouldn't want to handle . Please pay attention to it. You can only use it upon finishing the quest.
