  - statementId: 14
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: 'Ever since the mutation happened , we cannot simply go outdoors. The students here have special abilities that enable them to go outdoors, which is impossible for a person like me. I heard that the strange people outside are actually all dead. Strange isn''t it? I didn''t believe it at first but after listening carefully it definitely seems real. People with identical looks gathering together .... even if you talk to them it''s as if they cannot hear you. Even though I did not see it for myself I still think it''s rather strange. Come, the application form must be handed in to the Student Director. '
