    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: Click the right button of the mouse after selecting a skill scroll in order to learn the skill. Pressing the "K" key will let you see the skills you may be able to learn in the future, skills which are already available will be brightly litted , it will be easy for you to differentiate skills which are available for you to use from those that aren't . Choose the skills that are already available from the skills window and move it to the 1-10 numbers on the left of your screen. Select the skills from the numbers assigned to them and click on the right button of the mouse to use them according to the situation. However you must make sure you read carefully each skills function as every skill are different.
